<title>USA: Jones Intercable Inc Q4 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Jones Intercable Inc Q4 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr     loss    $1.01	     loss $0.23</p>
<p> Net     loss    31,554	    loss 7,217</p>
<p> Revs		76,414		   56,395</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  31,378		   31,291</p>
<p>	  12 months</p>
<p> Shr	loss   $2.00	   loss   $0.69</p>
<p> Net	loss   62,660	  loss   21,716</p>
<p> Revs		311,710		  188,838</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  31,372		   31,270</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Q4 1996 operating income before depreciation and amortization was $31.9 million vs $21.3 million in 1995. The increases reflect the company's acquisition of the Acquired Systems. Disregarding Acquired Systems, total revenues for the quarter would have been $39.2 million vs $35.2 million in 1995.</p>
<p>1995 full-year results include a $0.02 per share extraordinary loss</p>
